        "Content": "ACCOMMODATION\t\t\r\n\r\nGround Floor\t\t\r\n\r\nEntrance Hallway \t2.10m x 5.86m \tWith timber laminate flooring and staircase to first floor.\r\n\r\nSitting Room  \t3.10m x 3.70m \tFireplace with inset stove, timber laminate floor and bay window. \r\n\r\nKitchen/Dining \t7.80m x 3.60m \tWith timber laminate flooring, bay window, extensive fitted kitchen with floor and eye level units, stainless \r\nsteel sink, Countertop with tiled splashback, electric oven, gas hob and overhead extractor.\r\n\r\nUtility Room  \t1.75m x 1.80m \tCountertop space with built-in storage, plumbed for washing machine and dryer. Door to rear garden.\r\n\r\nBedroom 4\t3.45m x 3.57m \tWith laminate floor and built-in wardrobes.\r\n\r\nEnsuite \t1.00m x 2.35m \tTiled floor to ceiling, shower stall, heated towel rail, w.c. and w.h.b.\r\n\r\nFirst Floor \t\t\r\n\r\nLanding \t4.52m x 2.73m (max)\tWith timber laminate flooring.\r\n\r\nMaster Bedroom \t5.50m x 3.07m \tWith timber laminate flooring, built-in wardrobes and shower room ensuite.\r\n\r\nEnsuite \t0.95m x 2.28m \tTiled floor to ceiling, shower stall, w.c. and w.h.b.\r\n\r\nBedroom 2\t2.56m x 3.16m \tWith Velux window and timber laminate flooring. \r\n\r\nBedroom 3\t3.41m x 2.44m \tWith Velux window and timber laminate flooring. \r\n\r\nBathroom \t2.78m x 1.82m \tBath with shower over, w.c., heated towel rail and vanity w.h.b. \r\n\r\nTotal Floor Area: c. 128 sq. m. (c. 1,377 sq. ft.)\r\n\r\nOutside \r\n•\tLarge rear garden \r\n•\tFront garden \r\n•\tPatio area \r\n•\tGarden shed \r\n\r\nServices\r\n•\tOFCH \r\n•\tESB \r\n•\tElectric immersion \r\n•\tMains water\r\n•\tSeptic tank"
